  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Cyclone Freddy Emergency Response and Early Recovery Program (F-ERP)</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="PT">Programa de Resposta de Emerg&#xEA;ncia e Recupera&#xE7;&#xE3;o Antecipada do Ciclone Freddy (F-ERP)</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="PT">O objectivo &#xE9; aliviar o sofrimento humano, salvar vidas e meios de subsist&#xEA;ncia e reduzir o impacto f&#xED;sico, social e econ&#xF3;mico do ciclone Freddy. Os sectores s&#xE3;o agricultura e WASH. O n&#xFA;mero total de benefici&#xE1;rios que ser&#xE3;o apoiados no &#xE2;mbito deste pr&#xE9;mio &#xE9; de 57.000 indiv&#xED;duos.</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The goal is to alleviate human suffering, save lives and livelihoods, and reduce the physical, social, and economic impact of cyclone Freddy. The sectors are agriculture and WASH. The total number of beneficiaries that will be supported under this award is 57,000 individuals.</narrative>
  </description>
